@ContentService_HostAddress = http://localhost:7461
@timestamp = {{$timestamp}}

### ============================================
### ANALYSIS CONTENT TEST SCENARIOS
### ============================================
### Analysis workflow with multiple customer content items
### Same provider combinations as customer-content scenarios
###
### Analysis Structure:
### - Processes multiple customer content IDs together
### - Each item goes through outline → audio/video pipeline
### - Final video is composite/merged from all items
###
### Note: Use actual customerContentIds from successful customer-content tests
### ============================================

### ============================================
### GROUP 1: EXTERNAL VIDEO SCENARIOS (1-4)
### External video requires external audio input
### ============================================

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 001
### Analysis with Fast Outline + Quick Audio + Queue External Video
###
### Provider Chain: outline-fast → audio-quick → video-queue-external
### Expected Duration: ~38 seconds (per item)
###
### Test Purpose: Baseline analysis - verify multi-item outline/audio/video pipeline
### ============================================
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/analysis-contents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-001-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-001",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "Title": "Analysis Scenario 001 - Fast Outline + Quick Audio + Queue External Video",
  "CustomerContentIds": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"
  ]
}

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 002
### Analysis with Fast Outline + HQ Audio (Polling) + Queue External Video
###
### Provider Chain: outline-fast → audio-hq (polling) → video-queue-external (polling)
### Expected Duration: ~53 seconds (per item)
###
### Test Purpose: Verify HQ audio polling doesn't block video processing
### ============================================
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/analysis-contents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-002-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-002",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "Title": "Analysis Scenario 002 - Fast Outline + HQ Audio + Queue External Video",
  "CustomerContentIds": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006"
  ]
}

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 003
### Analysis with Queue Outline (Polling) + Quick Audio + Queue External Video
###
### Provider Chain: outline-queue (polling) → audio-quick → video-queue-external (polling)
### Expected Duration: ~43 seconds (per item)
###
### Test Purpose: Verify delayed outline start doesn't cascade delays
### ============================================
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/analysis-contents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-003-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-003",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "Title": "Analysis Scenario 003 - Queue Outline + Quick Audio + Queue External Video",
  "CustomerContentIds": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009"
  ]
}

### ============================================
