### ============================================
### GROUP 2: INTERNAL VIDEO SCENARIOS (5-6)
### Internal video creates audio internally
### ============================================

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 005
### Analysis with Fast Outline + Queue Internal Video (Generates Audio Internally)
###
### Provider Chain: outline-fast → video-queue-internal (creates own audio)
### Expected Duration: ~35 seconds (per item)
###
### Test Purpose: Verify internal video successfully handles multi-item analysis
### ============================================
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/analysis-contents
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-005-{{$timestamp}}

